* JanteStroemSpejl -- geometry-derived transistor netlist
* IHP SG13 low-voltage NMOS model syntax
*
* Geometry normalization from the drawing:
*   contact side = 2 lambda
*   diffusion stripe width = 4 lambda
*   poly extent along diffusion = 64 lambda
*   lambda = 0.08u if contact side = 0.16u
* => W = 0.32u, L = 5.12u
*
* IMPORTANT: every drawn transistor is explicit.
* No use of m or ng for arraying; model defaults ng=1, m=1.
*
* Preferred electrical reading of the artwork:
*   - central yellow vertical diffusion bus -> S
*   - all red-poly gates -> GREF through the white metal cross
*   - row 6 lies on the white horizontal metal bar; its two outer
*     diffusion contacts are therefore tied to GREF (diode-connected
*     reference pair)
*   - the other 10 left/right outer-contact pairs are mirror outputs
*   - body is not explicitly drawn; B is a separate net in RAW and
*     can be tied to S in the wrapper

.param lambda=0.08u
.param WJ='4*lambda'
.param LJ='64*lambda'

* Adapt this include path to your installation.
* Example SG13G2/CMOS5L front-end model library:
* .lib $PDK_ROOT/$PDK/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerMOSlv.lib mos_tt

.subckt JANTE_RAW GREF S B DL1 DL2 DL3 DL4 DL5 DL6 DL7 DL8 DL9 DL10 DL11 DR1 DR2 DR3 DR4 DR5 DR6 DR7 DR8 DR9 DR10 DR11
XJL01 DL1 GREF S B sg13_lv_nmos w={WJ} l={LJ}
XJR01 DR1 GREF S B sg13_lv_nmos w={WJ} l={LJ}
XJL02 DL2 GREF S B sg13_lv_nmos w={WJ} l={LJ}
XJR02 DR2 GREF S B sg13_lv_nmos w={WJ} l={LJ}
XJL03 DL3 GREF S B sg13_lv_nmos w={WJ} l={LJ}
XJR03 DR3 GREF S B sg13_lv_nmos w={WJ} l={LJ}
XJL04 DL4 GREF S B sg13_lv_nmos w={WJ} l={LJ}
XJR04 DR4 GREF S B sg13_lv_nmos w={WJ} l={LJ}
XJL05 DL5 GREF S B sg13_lv_nmos w={WJ} l={LJ}
XJR05 DR5 GREF S B sg13_lv_nmos w={WJ} l={LJ}
XJL06 GREF GREF S B sg13_lv_nmos w={WJ} l={LJ}
XJR06 GREF GREF S B sg13_lv_nmos w={WJ} l={LJ}
XJL07 DL7 GREF S B sg13_lv_nmos w={WJ} l={LJ}
XJR07 DR7 GREF S B sg13_lv_nmos w={WJ} l={LJ}
XJL08 DL8 GREF S B sg13_lv_nmos w={WJ} l={LJ}
XJR08 DR8 GREF S B sg13_lv_nmos w={WJ} l={LJ}
XJL09 DL9 GREF S B sg13_lv_nmos w={WJ} l={LJ}
XJR09 DR9 GREF S B sg13_lv_nmos w={WJ} l={LJ}
XJL10 DL10 GREF S B sg13_lv_nmos w={WJ} l={LJ}
XJR10 DR10 GREF S B sg13_lv_nmos w={WJ} l={LJ}
XJL11 DL11 GREF S B sg13_lv_nmos w={WJ} l={LJ}
XJR11 DR11 GREF S B sg13_lv_nmos w={WJ} l={LJ}
.ends JANTE_RAW

* 10-output wrapper: pair the left/right contacts of each ordinary row.
.subckt JANTE_MIRROR10 IREF S OUT1 OUT2 OUT3 OUT4 OUT5 OUT6 OUT7 OUT8 OUT9 OUT10
XCORE IREF S S OUT1 OUT2 OUT3 OUT4 OUT5 IREF OUT6 OUT7 OUT8 OUT9 OUT10 OUT1 OUT2 OUT3 OUT4 OUT5 IREF OUT6 OUT7 OUT8 OUT9 OUT10 JANTE_RAW
.ends JANTE_MIRROR10

* With identical devices, each OUTk consists of a left/right pair
* with total width 2*WJ, matching the two-device reference pair.
* Ideal mirror ratio per OUTk is therefore approximately 1:1.

.end